<h1>About</h1><p>This site lists furnace error codes and what they mean, taken from the manufacturers' installation and service manuals. Each code page links to the manual it came from.</p><p>We only publish codes we could check against a manual. If we could not read or confirm a code, we left it out.</p><p>This is general information, not professional advice. Gas furnaces can be dangerous. If you smell gas, leave the building and call your gas utility. For anything beyond basic checks, call a licensed HVAC technician.</p><p>Found a mistake? Check the linked manual for your exact model; manuals vary by model and revision.</p>
</Base>
